<title>HONG KONG: Nanjing Panda declares 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Nanjing Panda declares 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		     0.30</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)		0.054</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    25.65 loss</p>
<p>    Net				164.94</p>
<p>    Turnover			 3,442.32</p>
<p>    Company name		   Nanjing Panda Electronics Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    May 25 to June 25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     July 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Chinese television maker Nanjing Panda was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on May 2, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on writedown of stocks to net realisable value.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 0.108 yuan (including interim dividend of 0.054 yuan).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
